  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1: Fix package icon (was showing an incorrect/placeholder image). 1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientQueueClient wraps Azure.Storage.Queues QueueClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Includes QueueStorageTransientErrors predicate covering RequestFailedException (429, 503, 504), HttpRequestException, and TaskCanceledException. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
